This project is derived from YoneDesktopPet, maintained upstream by
DreamingBetter: https://github.com/DreamingBetter/YoneDesktopPet
Audit reference: 3c410d002e4c6b8ed2cbcb7689dc2b531a48653c (not a proven original import).

Section 1 preserves the complete upstream MIT license, including its original
unnamed copyright notice. DreamingBetter is credited as upstream maintainer;
no legal copyright-holder name has been inferred or inserted.
Section 2 applies only to subsequent modifications that ZINC is entitled to
license. It does not assert ZINC's ownership of the inherited upstream code.

The public candidate no longer contains the original character geometry
calibration tables identified in P4; P5 removed those measurements and annotations.
Character-related names, action slots, resource keys and other branding/text
boundaries remain. The code grants below do not license game media, artwork,
audio, game text, characters, trademarks or future third-party assets/profiles.
The upstream MIT/NOTICE and ZINC modification attribution remain applicable.
See docs/ASSETS.md. GitHub publication still requires final maintainer review
and explicit authorization; removing the tables does not clear every right.

